{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國中期選舉前，密歇根州民主黨內訌。</p><p>在初選中競逐密歇根州聯邦參議院議席落敗的聯邦眾議員史蒂文斯（Haley Stevens），周日（1日）倒戈支持共和黨參議院候選人，其後被民主黨除名，令選情出現意外轉折。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:01:14.139743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:08:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:14.160676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:58:29.894582+00:00","content_hash":"075dcb78b25fb58ac9c01efb785fc9cf9c51a76db1f92bf2ce19bb44a2c1aed1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}